00:10:35.330 --> 00:10:37.750
Those are two different things!

00:10:37.750 --> 00:10:38.330
--I'm just kidding, jeez!

00:10:38.330 --> 00:10:41.910
--Don't blame me if y'all get stuck again.
--I'm just kidding, jeez!

