00:14:45.750 --> 00:14:47.080
You're totally lying.

00:14:47.080 --> 00:14:49.040
Um...

00:14:49.040 --> 00:14:53.200
It wouldn't hurt for her to
join us, would it? We have a lot...

00:14:53.200 --> 00:14:54.500
Yeah.

00:14:54.500 --> 00:14:57.200
Really?! Yay!

00:14:58.250 --> 00:15:00.580
All right, I guess I'm done
with work for the day.

00:15:00.580 --> 00:15:02.910
