00:15:02.910 --> 00:15:05.620
Huh? What?

00:15:05.620 --> 00:15:07.790
I'm gettin' a headache...

00:15:07.790 --> 00:15:10.910
I give up. This is all on y'all now.

00:15:10.910 --> 00:15:12.620
Wha...?

00:15:17.540 --> 00:15:19.700
What?!

00:15:21.830 --> 00:15:23.580
