00:16:19.330 --> 00:16:19.910
"1981 Umino High School Breakwater Club"

00:16:19.910 --> 00:16:22.870
"1981 Umino High School Breakwater Club"
Why did you become our advisor, Ms. Kotani?

00:16:22.870 --> 00:16:25.870
