00:16:25.870 --> 00:16:28.870
Well, you see...

00:16:28.870 --> 00:16:33.450
If I come here, I have plenty of
snacks to go with my beer for free!

00:16:33.450 --> 00:16:35.200
Yes! It's the best!

00:16:35.200 --> 00:16:37.660
She really is a beer-obsessed drunk.

00:16:39.370 --> 00:16:43.700
