Always?!

00:17:00.910 --> 00:17:03.830
Um, Ms. Kotani?

00:17:03.830 --> 00:17:07.660
Uh... Are you sure you
should be drinking right now?

00:17:07.660 --> 00:17:11.040
We're doing club activities right now...

00:17:11.040 --> 00:17:15.120
Well, all you're going
to do today is eat, right?

00:17:18.370 --> 00:17:21.080
So basically, you're done
with club activities for the day.

00:17:21.080 --> 00:17:24.200
I did my job as advisor and took off my coat,

00:17:24.200 --> 00:17:26.660
so I'm done with teaching duties for the day!

00:17:26.660 --> 00:17:29.080
Meaning I can drink all I want!

00:17:29.080 --> 00:17:31.290
I-I'm not sure if that's the issue here...

00:17:31.290 --> 00:17:33.200
Oh, you're worried about my car?

00:17:33.200 --> 00:17:38.370
Have no fear! The nice fisherman
said I could park my car here overnight.

00:17:38.370 --> 00:17:40.790
My apartment's not that far, so I'm set!

00:17:40.790 --> 00:17:42.450
I-I see...

00:17:42.450 --> 00:17:45.410
That's not what I'm talking about, but...

00:17:45.410 --> 00:17:50.500
Also, I'm off the clock now,
so you can just call me Sayaka.

00:17:50.500 --> 00:17:52.910
You can even call me Sis.

00:17:52.910 --> 00:17:55.160
She's sorta scary...

00:17:56.540 --> 00:17:57.830
All done.

00:17:59.160 --> 00:18:01.080
There we go!

00:18:01.080 --> 00:18:03.250
We have butter-grilled
and some steamed with sake.

00:18:03.250 --> 00:18:06.500
Please go ahead and dispose
of the shells in the bowl.

00:18:06.500 --> 00:18:08.330
They look so good!

00:18:08.330 --> 00:18:10.910
Down the hatch!

00:18:12.290 --> 00:18:14.700
Annoyin', ain't she?

00:18:14.700 --> 00:18:18.500
Are you really one to talk?

00:18:18.500 --> 00:18:19.790
Okay...

00:18:19.790 --> 00:18:21.450
Let's eat.

00:18:25.450 --> 00:18:26.910
--They're so plump!
--They're so good!

00:18:26.910 --> 00:18:28.500
--Damn, that's good!
--They're so plump!
--They're so good!

00:18:28.500 --> 00:18:30.790
She's ruining the moment...

00:18:30.790 --> 00:18:33.500
You can just eat these for days!

00:18:33.500 --> 00:18:35.450
Hey! You're eating too much!

00:18:35.450 --> 00:18:38.040
There won't be any left for us.

00:18:42.370 --> 00:18:44.950
She basically ate all of them herself!

00:18:44.950 --> 00:18:47.120
Th-That's so cruel...

00:18:54.700 --> 00:18:59.250
Ohno! Thanks for always making great food!

00:18:59.250 --> 00:19:01.330
I-I, um...

00:19:01.330 --> 00:19:01.750
--Now she's crying.

00:19:01.750 --> 00:19:03.200
--Can I just be your wife already?
--Now she's crying.

00:19:03.200 --> 00:19:06.540
--Can I just be your wife already?

00:19:06.540 --> 00:19:08.870
P-Please stop...

00:19:08.870 --> 00:19:10.040
Kissing monster...

00:19:10.040 --> 00:19:11.950
She's single?

00:19:11.950 --> 00:19:14.950
She rejected me! It's all your fault!

00:19:14.950 --> 00:19:16.870
Now, kiss me!

00:19:16.870 --> 00:19:18.540
The hell are ya talkin' about?

00:19:18.540 --> 00:19:20.580
Ugh, yer so annoyin'!

00:19:20.580 --> 00:19:21.910
She's getting in everyone's faces.

00:19:21.910 --> 00:19:23.870
This is the worst.

00:19:28.410 --> 00:19:31.870
After all that, she fell asleep.

00:19:31.870 --> 00:19:35.700
Of course this club would
have an advisor like that...

00:19:37.370 --> 00:19:40.830
That's why I told ya to not let her drink.

00:19:40.830 --> 00:19:42.580
You didn't say anything.

00:19:42.580 --> 00:19:44.830
Not a thing.

00:19:44.830 --> 00:19:45.950
Take a hint.

00:19:45.950 --> 00:19:47.660
Yeah, that wasn't happening.

00:19:47.660 --> 00:19:52.830
Thank goodness we still
had some left to grill out here.

00:19:52.830 --> 00:19:55.120
Let's eat these while she's still asleep.

00:19:55.120 --> 00:19:57.080
Yay!

00:20:01.910 --> 00:20:04.700
The flavor's really bold and delicious
when you grill them on the net.

00:20:04.700 --> 00:20:07.540
The juices are really good.

00:20:08.700 --> 00:20:11.120
I think the Asian hard calm's about to open.

00:20:12.290 --> 00:20:13.330
It opened!

00:20:13.330 --> 00:20:16.450
I guess the meat sticks
to the top of those, too.

00:20:17.830 --> 00:20:20.870
The clam's adductor muscle
let's go of the side that's grilling,

00:20:20.870 --> 00:20:23.370
so if you flip it immediately, it'll be fine.

00:20:23.370 --> 00:20:27.000
Then you just add a drop of soy sauce.

00:20:32.040 --> 00:20:34.370
It smells so good!

00:20:35.950 --> 00:20:37.410
Here you go.

00:20:37.410 --> 00:20:40.160
Wow! The meat barely fits
in the shell anymore.

00:20:40.160 --> 00:20:43.120
Well, they are meatier than Manila clams.

00:20:49.870 --> 00:20:51.160
What's up?

00:20:51.160 --> 00:20:53.540
I'm sorry that I'm eating this by myself.

00:20:53.540 --> 00:20:56.700
No worries. Yer the one that found it.

00:20:56.700 --> 00:20:59.580
Yes. It's all yours, Hina.

00:20:59.580 --> 00:21:01.910
If you don't hurry up, you're gonna drop it.

00:21:01.910 --> 00:21:04.410
If yer not gonna eat it, I'll eat it for ya.

00:21:04.410 --> 00:21:06.450
I-I'll eat it!

00:21:08.620 --> 00:21:12.790
Okay... Here I--

00:21:29.330 --> 00:21:31.330
Damn, that's good!

00:21:31.330 --> 00:21:35.120
Well, see ya kids later! Thanks for the grub!

00:21:35.120 --> 00:21:37.410
She's awful...

00:21:37.410 --> 00:21:43.540
Come to think of it, she falls asleep fast,
but she wakes up super fast, too.

00:21:43.540 --> 00:21:46.330
I told you to hurry up and eat it.

00:21:50.330 --> 00:21:54.290
Tsurugi... Let's go clammin' again sometime.

00:21:56.040 --> 00:21:58.160
Today's haiku...

00:21:58.160 --> 00:21:59.620
"Make sure yer mindful

00:21:59.620 --> 00:22:01.250
of both size and the amount

00:22:01.250 --> 00:22:02.750
when ya go clammin'."

00:22:02.750 --> 00:22:04.290
By Yuki.
